<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπι-τίμητος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[τῑ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be censured,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1154b4
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>
			<i>for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				61.54
			</span></i>; <i>uncriticized,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.245
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unpunished,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				35.2.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				<u>Praef.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.219
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not estimated</i> or <i>rated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1241.14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.1059.7
			</span></i>.</div>
